      },
      {
        "id": "p5-q6-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "How many matches did they play in the month?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "10 matches.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Total matches}&=4+2+1+0+2+1\\\\\\text{Total matches}&=10\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 14
      },
      {
        "id": "p5-q6-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "How many aces did they serve in total during the month?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "17 aces.\n\nMultiply aces per match by the corresponding frequency, then add the products.",
          "worked": "Multiply each number of aces by its match frequency, then add. $$\\begin{align*}\\text{Total aces}&=0\\times4+1\\times2+2\\times1+3\\times0+4\\times2+5\\times1\\\\\\text{Total aces}&=0+2+2+0+8+5\\\\\\text{Total aces}&=17\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 23
      }
